OL,3,GNEWSAFormer biker hits the road again
OL,4,Afor sidecar ride
OL,5,
OL,6,FSixty-six years after Valerie Harvey
OL,7,Fpurchased her first motorbike aged 21,
OL,8,Fshe found herself riding away from her
OL,9,Fcare home with the wind in her hair.
OL,11,FThe 87-year-old has dementia and lives
OL,12,Fat Heath Lodge Care Home in Holt,
OL,13,FNorfolk, where her care workers
OL,14,Farranged for her to go for a ride in a
OL,15,Fsidecar of a 1928 Panther Sloper 600
OL,16,Flast month.
OL,18,FHer son, Kevin Harvey, said his mum
OL,19,Fbought her first Norton 16H motorcycle
OL,20,Fin 1957, which was a former World War
OL,21,FTwo dispatch bike dating from 1942.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
